ame"},"parameters":["Yeti","Animation","=","\"Walk\""]},{"type":{"value":"AnimatableCapability::AnimatableBehavior::SetName"},"parameters":["Tribal","Animation","=","\"FastFlying\""]}]},{"disabled":true,"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::CompareStrings"},"parameters":["Hedge_Large_Hor.MazeObject::MazeObjectWallDirection()","=","\"LeftWall\""]}],"actions":[]}],"layers":[{"ambientLightColorB":200,"ambientLightColorG":200,"ambientLightColorR":200,"camera2DPlaneMaxDrawingDistance":5000.0,"camera3DFarPlaneDistance":10000.0,"camera3DFieldOfView":45.0,"camera3DNearPlaneDistance":3.0,"cameraType":"","followBaseLayerCamera":false,"isLightingLayer":false,"isLocked":false,"name":"","renderingType":"","visibility":true,"cameras":[{"defaultSize":true,"defaultViewport":true,"height":0.0,"viewportBottom":1.0,"viewportLeft":0.0,"viewportRight":1.0,"viewportTop":0.0,"width":0.0}],"effects":[{"effectType":"Scene3D::HemisphereLight","name":"3D Ambient Hemisphere Light","doubleParameters":{"elevation":40.0,"intensity":0.33,"rotation":300.0},"stringParameters":{"groundColor":"127;127;127","skyColor":"255;255;255","top":"Z+"},"booleanParameters":{}},{"effectType":"Scene3D::DirectionalLight","name":"3D Sun Light","doubleParameters":{"distanceFromCamera":1500.0,"elevation":40.0,"frustumSize":4000.0,"intensity":0.75,"minimumShadowBias":0.0,"rotation":300.0},"stringParameters":{"color":"255;255;255","shadowQuality":"high","shadowRenderingMode":"fittedToCameraView","top":"Z+"},"booleanParameters":{"isCastingShadow":true}}]}],"behaviorsSharedData":[{"name":"Animation","type":"AnimatableCapability::AnimatableBehavior"},{"name":"Flippable","type":"FlippableCapability::FlippableBehavior"},{"name":"MazeObject","type":"MazeGenerator::MazeObject"},{"name":"Object3D","type":"Scene3D::Base3DBehavior"},{"name":"Physics3D","type":"Physics3D::Physics3DBehavior","gravityX":0.0,"gravityY":0.0,"gravityZ":-9.8,"worldScale":100.0},{"name":"Resizable","type":"ResizableCapability::ResizableBehavior"},{"name":"Scale","type":"ScalableCapability::ScalableBehavior"}]}],"externalEvents":[],"eventsFunctionsExtensions":[{"author":"","category":"","dimension":"","extensionNamespace":"","fullName":"Maze Generator","gdevelopVersion":"","helpPath":"","iconUrl":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","name":"MazeGenerator","previewIconUrl":"https://resources.gdevelop-app.com/assets/Icons/Line Hero Pack/Master/SVG/Graphic Design/Graphic Design_grid.svg","shortDescription":"Create a maze made of a grid of rectangular cells. Walls are created randomly so that every cell is reachable through a random path through the maze. ","version":"0.2.0","description":["Provides functions for generating mazes. ","","Use **GenerateMaze** action to set up a maze with a particular size and give it a name (MazeID). The maze is stored in scene variables, to be used with other functions by specifying the MazeID. ","","There are three other actions that create sprite objects you can use to place the maze into the scene:","**CreateMazeFloorObjects** : create tiles for each cell in the maze","**CreateMazeWallObjects**: create objects between each cell. Useful for walls","**CreateMazeCornerObjects**: create objects on the point between 4 cell corners. Can be useful to improve maze visuals","","There are plenty of other helper functions for getting/setting maze properites or get helpful information. In particular:","**CheckMazeWall**: a condition to use in event sheet to test which walls exist for a cell","**FindMazePath**: creates a scene variable array containing a sequence of directions to go from one cell to another cell","","Finally, there is a **MazeObject** behavior that can be attached to wall or floor objects to provide some additional helper conditions, expressions, and actions. See the example gdevelop file in the help URL for examples of its use. ","","3D support: **CreateMaze3DFloorObjects**, **CreateMaze3DWallObjects** and **CreateMaze3DCornerObjects** work like the sprite actions above but accept any object (e.g. 3D models) with the 3D and Resizable behaviors.","They position objects by their center and take a Z position and optional depth.","","**GenerateMazeWithSeed** works like GenerateMaze but takes a Seed number: the same seed (with the same size) always produces the same maze. Seed 0 is random each time.",""],"tags":["Maze","Random","Grid"],"authorIds":["DywSeWMoakatMQn720ZtKbI8u4N2"],"dependencies":[],"globalVariables":[],"sceneVariables":[],"eventsFunctions":[{"description":"Specify the overall size of a maze, and the size of the tile \"cells\" inside the maze. Walls are randomly generated to form the maze. The maze is stored in memory, and can be referenced using a name called MazeID that is chosen here. The maze generator extension comes with other actions that reference this mazeID, which can be used to create actual wall and floor objects to place the maze into the scene. ","fullName":"Generate a maze","functionType":"Action","name":"GenerateMaze","sentence":"Create a random maze called _PARAM7_ at point x=_PARAM1_, y=_PARAM2_ of width _PARAM3_ and height _PARAM4_, made with _PARAM5_ by _PARAM6_ cells","events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"The maze is initialized with 4 boolean arrays (rows * columns elements), one for each direction to track presence of a wall. From a random starting point, a loop moves an index variable through the maze picking a random direction each time to remove a wall and create a path. Once there are no more adjacent cells not yet visited (another array \"FloorToDo\" tracks visited or not visited yet), the completed cell is removed from the \"FloorInProgress\" array and it goes back to a previous cell  to try additional directions from there. Once all cells are completed the resulting arrays are stored in a structure to be used with the other maze  functions"},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].FloorWidth","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"CellWidth\")"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].FloorHeight","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"CellHeight\")"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].MazeX","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeX\")"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].MazeY","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeY\")"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].MazeWidth","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeWidth\")"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].MazeHeight","=","GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeHeight\")"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns","=","floor(GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeWidth\")/ Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].FloorWidth))"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumRows","=","floor(GetArgumentAsNumber(\"MazeHeight\")/ Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].FloorHeight))"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumberOfCells","=","Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns) * Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumRows)"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].RightWall"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].LeftWall"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].DownWall"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].UpWall"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo"]},{"type":{"value":"VariableClearChildren"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Repeat","repeatExpression":"Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumberOfCells)","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushBool"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].RightWall","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushBool"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].LeftWall","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushBool"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].DownWall","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushBool"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].UpWall","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushBool"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo","True"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"Pick a random cell to start from, append it to an array that will track the in-progress spaces in the maze"},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushNumber"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress","MazeGenerator::MazeRandomInRange(0,Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns) * Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumRows)- 1) "]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress","=","1"]}]},{"infiniteLoopWarning":true,"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::While","whileConditions":[{"type":{"value":"VarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress",">","0"]}],"conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushString"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions","\"Left\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushString"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions","\"Right\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushString"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions","\"Up\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushString"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions","\"Down\""]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.numDirections","=","4"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Index","=","Variable(__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress[Variable(__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress)-1])"]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]",""]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.PickDirection","=","0"]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection",""]}],"events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"Try each direction in a random order to see if maze can build in that direction (wall exists in that direction, next cell in that direction hasn't been completed yet)"},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Repeat","repeatExpression":"4","conditions":[],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.PickDirection","=","MazeGenerator::MazeRandomInRange(0,Variable(__MazeGenerator.numDirections)-1)"]}],"events":[{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Comment","color":{"b":109,"g":230,"r":255,"textB":0,"textG":0,"textR":0},"comment":"The conditions to check for each direction are:\n1. Check the direction picked randomly, stored in Directions variable\n2. There is a wall that could be removed to make a new path in that direction ( ...Wall arrays contain \"TRUE\" if there is a wall there. All walls initialize as existing then we remove some to create the path)\n3. Treat the maze boundaries as impassible. For top and bottom edge, the cell Index number being moved to has to be within the total number of cells in the maze. For the left and right edge, (index Modulo # of columns = zero) for cells on the left edge, and (index Modulo # of columns = # of columns - 1) for cells on the right edge\n4. Don't move to a space we have already visited before (FloorTodo array starts as true for all cells, goes to false once visited). This prevents the maze from being too easy by having too many ways to get to each cell in the maze\n5. Once a valid direction is found, skip all the other directions (FoundDirection is true once a direction is found). If the first direction it finds isn't valid, then the loop repeats again to try one of the other directions instead"},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"VarSceneTxt"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions[Variable(__MazeGenerator.PickDirection)]","=","\"Left\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].LeftWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"Egal"},"parameters":["mod(Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index), Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns))","!=","0"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-1]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","False"]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].LeftWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].RightWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-1]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushNumber"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress","Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-1"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress","+","1"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"VarSceneTxt"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions[Variable(__MazeGenerator.PickDirection)]","=","\"Right\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].RightWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"Egal"},"parameters":["mod(Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index), Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns))","!=","Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns) - 1"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)+1]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","False"]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].RightWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].LeftWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)+1]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushNumber"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress","Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)+1"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress","+","1"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"VarSceneTxt"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions[Variable(__MazeGenerator.PickDirection)]","=","\"Up\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].UpWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"VarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Index",">=","Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns)"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorTodo[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns)]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","False"]}],"actions":[{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FoundDirection","True"]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].UpWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SetSceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].DownWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns)]",""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariablePushNumber"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.FloorInProgress","Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)-Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns)"]},{"type":{"value":"ModVarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.NumFloorInProgress","+","1"]}]},{"type":"BuiltinCommonInstructions::Standard","conditions":[{"type":{"value":"VarSceneTxt"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Directions[Variable(__MazeGenerator.PickDirection)]","=","\"Down\""]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].DownWall[Variable(__MazeGenerator.Index)]","True"]},{"type":{"value":"VarScene"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Index","<","Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumberOfCells) - Variable(__MazeGenerator[GetArgumentAsString(\"MazeID\")].NumColumns)"]},{"type":{"value":"SceneVariableAsBoolean"},"parameters":["__MazeGenerator.Floo